W
  ====
  - [[Page~217 #8: (4)嚟]]
    --
    A colloquial word used for 來 _(4)loi_ [[loi4]]_;_
    --
    ==
    - to come;
    - able;
    - to begin;
    - used with other verbs, to denote a command,
      as _(1)ning (4)ch(')(a/) (4)lai_ [[ning1 caa4 lai4]],
      bring tea here;
    - a final particle, making the present perfect tense;
    - _yau(6) (4)lai yau(6) h(u:)(3)_
        [[jau6 lai4 jau6 heoi3]]
        coming and going;
    - _(4)lai (4)'m (4)ts(')ang_
        [[lai4 m4 cang4]],
        has he come yet?
    - _(2)t(')ai (4)lai ts(')au(3) (4)lo_
        [[tai2 lai4 cau3 lo4]],
        see if it can do, or will suit;
    - _(4)lai lok(8)_
        [[lai4 lok3]]
        coming!---used as a reply;
    - _(1)f(a/)n (4)lai_
        [[faan1 lai4]],
        come back;
    - _ts(o\)(6) mat(7) (5)y(e/) (4)lai_
        [[zou6 mat1 je5 lai4]],
        what have you been doing?
    - _ch(')ut(7) (1)k(a/)i (4)lai_
        [[ceot1 gaai1 lai4]],
        I have been out;
    - _(4)lai (2)ch(i/) (4)p(')(a/)i_
        [[lai4 zi2 paai4-2]],
        to play cards.
    ==
  ====
$$
